"<br>"
"<br>The icon border shows bookmark signs, for instance."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylmä yanıq bulsa, yaña küreneşlärneñ sul yağında tamğalar kürsätü öçen "
"östämä buy kürsäteläçäk."
"<br>"
"<br>Bitbilge tamğaları da ul buyda kürsätelä."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:717
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, every new view will show marks on the vertical "
"scrollbar."
"<br>"
"<br>These marks will, for instance, show bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylmä yanıq bulsa, yaña küreneşlärneñ asma çornawtirädä tamğalar "
"kürsäteläçäk."
"<br>"
"<br>Bitbilge tamğaların ul buyda kürsätep bula."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:721
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, every new view will display marks for code folding, "
