msgid "File Changed on Disk"
msgstr "Disktäge Birem Üzgärgän"

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1585
msgid ""
"Reload the file from disk. If you have unsaved changes, they will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Disk biremennän yañadan yökläw. Bar bulğan saqlanmağan üzgäreşlär yuğalaçaq."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1590
msgid "&Ignore"
msgstr "&Uzası"

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1593
msgid "Ignore the changes. You will not be prompted again."
msgstr "Üzgäreşkä qaramasqa. Bütän soralmas."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1594
msgid ""
"Do nothing. Next time you focus the file, or try to save it or close it, you "
"will be prompted again."
msgstr ""
"Ber ni eşlämä. Bu biremne tağın saylağan, saqlağan yä yapqan çaqta bu täräzä "
"qabat kürsäteläçäk."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1612
msgid "&View Difference"
msgstr "&Ayırmasın Kürü"

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1617
msgid ""
"Calculates the difference between the editor contents and the disk file using "
"diff(1) and opens the diff file with the default application for that."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanğan istälek öçen anıñ disk eçendäge söreme belän arasında bulğan "
"ayırma ezläp, ul ayırma biremen töp yazılımda açu."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1621
msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Östän Yaz"

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1622
msgid "Overwrite the disk file with the editor content."
msgstr "Biremneñ disk eçendäge söremen tözätkeçtäge belän almaştıru."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1673
msgid ""
"The diff command failed. Please make sure that diff(1) is installed and in your "
"PATH."
msgstr ""
"\"diff\" digän boyırıq uzmadı. Bu sanaqnıñ PATH yulı aşa anı tabıp buluın "
"tikşerep alası bar."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1675
msgid "Error Creating Diff"
msgstr "Ayırma Yasaw Xatası"

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1688
msgid ""
"Ignoring means that you will not be warned again (unless the disk file changes "
"once more): if you save the document, you will overwrite the file on disk; if "
"you do not save then the disk file (if present) is what you have."
msgstr ""
"Qaramasqa diü bu belderüneñ bütän kürsätelmäçägen añlata (disk bireme bütän "
"üzgärtelmäsä ikän). Bu birem üzgärtelgän bulsa, başqa yazılımnan yasalğan "
"üzgäreşlär yuğalaçaq."

#: part/katedialogs.cpp:1692
msgid "You Are on Your Own"
msgstr "Üz Üzäreşlär"

